ool's roof he bumps into a girl and see she is wearing strawberry panties, the girl runs away but leaves behind her a notebook.\n\nManaka finds out that the notebook belongs to Aya Tojo, but he believes that the girl was Tsukasa Nishino the most popular girl in school and confess to her.\n\nAfter Tsukasa agrees she becomes Manaka's girlfriend.\n\nOn their way home they talk about going to the same school and Manaka agrees. \n\nManaka asks Aya to help him study so he will get accepted to the school he wants to go to.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eY3mbZwmFAPkigfMRrD8PV8wRHD.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"88506","synopsis":"After Tsukasa finds out that Aya is helping Manaka study every morning she decides to talk with Aya and in the end decides to join them.\n\nKomiyama finds out about this and joins them at the library.\n\nAt the day of the entrance exam a beautifull girl appears, it is the girl from the roof. \n\nWhen the test start the girl enters the class and declares that she is Aya Tojo. \n\nManaka can't stop thinking about her and in the end of the day he realizes that he loves her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f5lQYLNxXvOawXnJ4V25At2dQXt.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"88507","synopsis":"After the exams everyone has passed and entered the school. \n\nIn the day of graduating Manaka meets Tsukasa that tells him she know he likes Aya and she's not going to the same school as he is.\n\nThey break up and Manaka and Aya meet at the roof again.\n\nOne morning Manaka wakes up and sees his childhood friend Yui half naked. \n\nYui tells him that she came to check out schools for next year and they go out to look.\n\nOn their way back they they see two dogs which Yui is scared of and Manaka save them from being attacked.\n\nIn the morning Yui was supposed to leave she slept too much and missed her train.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hlQ9xJbfQbh9ftM2ZTw5Yni3TyS.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"88508","synopsis":"Manaka got a video camera for his graduation and goes filming in the park. While he was filming a girl the wind came and showed her panties to him.\n\nOn the first day of school everyone is attracted to Aya and before class Manaka finds out that the girl from the park is in his class and her name is Kitaouji Satsuki.\n\nThe next day Aya comes to school differently and by accident starts a fight which in the end causes Satsuki to understand something.\n\nManaka wants to revive the film club but in order to do it he needs 5 members. He asks Komiyama and a also a guy named Sotomura appears and wants to join. And finally Satsuki offers that she will also join the club.\n\nManaka meets Aya on the roof where she tells him that she already joined a club and runs away. Satsuki come to ask what happened and while talking to Manaka she tells him that she likes him.\n\nOn his way home, Manaka meets Tsukasa.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cAqovpKKA0KuuKrlM6E1hIZAorq.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"88509","synopsis":"Manaka invites Aya to his house in order to find an idea for their film. \n\nWhile they are there Tsukasa, Satsuki, Komiyama, Yui, Sotomura and Oukusa apears and everything goes wrong.\n\nFor their summer camp the filming club goes to the beach. \n\nAt night Manaka meets Satsuki in the hallway and they talk.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oWaKy3f73OUeVHJp75zndJIkB0E.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"88510","synopsis":"It is Nisino's birthday and she waits for something that will happen, what is this thing she's waiting for?\n\nIn the night she and Manaka meet.\n\nIn order for Manaka to decide on who he loves and should date he goes to Oukusa for help. \n\nManaka decides and tells Satsuki something that would surprise her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ffc6Qk6G6RRulapXs0p3etTLZr7.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"88511","synopsis":"クリスマスが近づいてきた。真中は女の子たちにプレゼントをするため、バイトをはじめる。バイト先のハンバーガーショップで、偶然、さつきと一緒に働くことになる真中。それを唯に目撃されてしまい……。\n\n/\n\nクリスマスの前日、西野の家でケーキを食べる真中。西野はそこで真中に本当の気持ちを問う。しかし、自分の気持ちに整理がついていない真中は西野の想いにこたえることができない。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qhCyRGGafnUgrlvnDktDSeB87a7.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"88512","synopsis":"お正月。唯の受験の手伝いをするため、家庭教師として真中の家に東城がやってきた。ふとした瞬間に二人きりになる真中と東城。真中は東城と話すうちに、出会った頃のことを思い出す。\n\n/\n\n受験を前に一度、帰郷することにした唯。帰郷の前日、唯は真中ら映像研究部の面々と一緒に遊ぶことになる。そこで唯が提案した遊びは、真中と唯がかつてよくやった、かくれんぼだった。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zI8kx3VXNcIiPATP5F9MoBWz8Uq.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"88513","synopsis":"バレンタインデーを前にして、さつきとケンカする真中。バレンタインデー当日、東城はチョコをくれたが、さつきとは口をきくこともできない。しかし、真中が帰宅すると、家の前にひとつの箱入りチョコが置いてあった。\n\n/\n\n玄関先のチョコをさつきが置いてくれたものだと思った真中は、さつきにお礼を言う。それをきっかけにして仲直りする二人。しかし、実はそのチョコは、西野が置いてくれたものだった！？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ltVDxq2AhuW10tkhM82nZeyAnh.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"88514","synopsis":"ホワイトデー。真中はチョコをくれた女の子たちにお返しをしようとする。そんな真中の前に現れたのは西野だった。バレンタインの差出人不明のチョコが西野のものだと知った真中は……。\n\n/\n\n東城と初めてのデートをすることになった真中。一緒に映画を見て、共通の趣味を持つことの喜びを感じる真中だったが、そこにキツい口調で映画の内容を批判するひとりの女の子が現れた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nveirwYjIGlkSHHASdCULC4xzOc.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"88515","synopsis":"新学期を迎え、二年生になった真中たち。気持ちも新たに映画作りを頑張ろうとするが、映像部の新入部員を見て、真中は驚く。その新入部員は、映画館で出会ったあの少女だったのだ。\n\n/\n\nさつきの気持ちに応えられない真中は、誕生日にプレゼントを受け取ることを断る。ショックを受けるさつき。そこに、プレゼントを持って東城がやってきた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t3lwKtm9HDa33fbGY7ES8PwUhRo.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24